From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Jun 2026 06:33:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01241/11171] [conductor] DECENTRALIZATION stronger-base --
 COLLECT+VALIDATE (G3): poll the backgrounded run from exp4036; report whether
 the stronger local base's best-of-N demo-perfect coverage rises above
 exp4012's 0.2581 (gemma-4-12B) ceiling. Diagnose: coverage rises materially
 (CI excludes the 0.2581 baseline) -> the abstraction is LATENT in the larger
 local model -> distillation/RLVR viable, the sovereign path scales with base
 size; coverage stays flat -> the abstraction is ABSENT (the Invisible Leash
 holds) -> sovereignty needs a still-stronger base, not more training. Report
 the cost (local seconds vs codex 46s/task; the model-free verifier is ~free).
 Honest negative is a COMPLETE verdict.

Automated research step by research conductor.
Task ID: exp4037-decentralization-stronger-base-collect

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
